<title>USA: Computer Task wins $5.6 mln Florida deal.</title>
<headline>Computer Task wins $5.6 mln Florida deal.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH, Fla 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer Task Group Inc said Tuesday it had won a three-year contract worth $5.6 million from Palm Beach County to create a computer data base for its criminal justice department.</p>
<p>The company said the data base would link all of the department's agencies, allowing them to share information and enhance inter-agency communicationa.</p>
</text>
